en:
//　今度は様子を見よう。
  I'd rather not get hit by that whatever that was a second time. 

  This time, we'll play it safe.

//　俺は太刀を振りかぶり、迎え撃つ――
//　
//　と見せるだけしておき、打ち合う刹那に大きく進路
//を変えた。
  I raise my sword as though preparing a counter, then at the last moment, dive and veer wide.

//　真っ正直な一撃を躱し、
//　そして、
  The enemy's axe cleaves through empty space, and then―

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/mc01/010vs0010a00'>
//「……見えたか!?」
"Did you see it!?"

//【村正】
<voice name='村正' class='村正さん' src='voice/mc01/010vs0020a01'>
//《駄目！
//　けれど一つ。あれは<RUBY text='・・'>射撃</RUBY>じゃない》
《No! But I'm sure now it's not a projectile!》

//【村正】
<voice name='村正' class='村正さん' src='voice/mc01/010vs0030a01'>
//《間違いなく、何かの<RUBY text='・・'>打撃</RUBY>よ》
《They're striking us directly!》

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/mc01/010vs0040a00'>
//「…………」
"......"

//　よもや、<RUBY text='あし'>足脚</RUBY>を器用に使って蹴りを入れてきている
//わけではあるまいが……。
  Don't tell me the enemy's kicking us as we pass. You'd have to be a contortionist!
